# Public feature flags the release rehearsal BUILDS the app with.
#
# These are NEXT_PUBLIC_* switches only — values that are printed into the
# public JavaScript of the site anyway. NEVER put a key, token or password here.
#
# Production's real values live in Vercel and a session cannot read them from
# the repo, so this file is the rehearsal's own statement of "the release as it
# will be switched on". Keep it equal to what production will run AFTER the
# upload being rehearsed.
#
